  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The 'Merc with a Mouth' finally has his own NES game. The plot involves Deadpool being beaten in a duel with DC's Deathstroke, and then being given the Infinity Gauntlet by a mysterious young woman. Trying to keep safe, he runs into a number of enemies, including some heroes and villains from across the Marvel and DC universe. Still searching for Francis, Deadpool finds himself in a larger plot involving Death and Thanos."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "El Mercenario Bocazas finalmente tiene su propio juego para NES. La trama sigue a Deadpool tras ser derrotado en un duelo contra Deathstroke de DC, momento en el que una misteriosa joven le entrega el Guantelete del Infinito. Tratando de mantenerse a salvo, se enfrenta a numerosos enemigos, incluidos héroes y villanos de los universos de Marvel y DC. Aún en busca de Francis, Deadpool se ve envuelto en una conspiración mayor que involucra a la Muerte y a Thanos."
    }
  ],
